OL,4,CIsraeli military completes ground      
OL,5,Coperation in Gaza beyond Yellow Line   
OL,6,GIsraeli forces have completed a rare   
OL,7,Gground operation in part of central    
OL,8,GGaza outside their control, the        
OL,9,Gmilitary says, a day after residents   
OL,10,Gwere ordered to evacuate.              
OL,12,FFamilies fled their homes and tents on 
OL,13,FWednesday as tanks advanced into an    
OL,14,Farea east of Nuseirat refugee camp and 
OL,15,Fonto the territory's main north-south  
OL,16,Froad under the cover of artillery      
OL,17,Fstrikes.                               
